  - id: reflect.finish
    stepId: reflect
    stationId: mai
    nextStepId: complete
    label: "Nh\xECn l\u1EA1i ti\u1EBFt d\u1EA1y v\u1EDBi c\xF4 Mai"
    tradeoff: "5 ph\xFAt \xB7 xem b\u1EB1ng ch\u1EE9ng, ch\u1ECDn \u0111i\u1EC1u mu\u1ED1n th\u1EED \u1EDF ti\u1EBFt sau."
    feedback: "C\xF4 Mai: \u2018H\xE3y xem \u0111i\u1EC1u g\xEC c\xF3 b\u1EB1ng ch\u1EE9ng v\xE0 \u0111i\u1EC1u g\xEC c\xF2n c\u1EA7n ki\u1EC3m tra. M\u1ED9t ti\u1EBFt h\u1ECDc kh\xF4ng quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh s\u1EF1 ph\xF9 h\u1EE3p ngh\u1EC1 nghi\u1EC7p\u2019. "
    evidence: "Trao \u0111\u1ED5i sau ti\u1EBFt h\u1ECDc v\xE0 x\xE1c \u0111\u1ECBnh vi\u1EC7c c\u1EA7n c\u1EA3i thi\u1EC7n."
